@local/dsh-opencode-go-quota README · 動作要件：- DSH の Web プロファイル（`connection` サービスを使います）
- OpenCode Go または Go Plus の契約と API キー（`oc_sk_` で始まる文字列）
- DSH が動作する Node.js。このリポジトリは DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 と Node.js 22 で確認しています

@local/dsh-opencode-go-quota README · API キー：```json
{"usage":{"rolling":{"status":"ok","percent":14,"resetsAt":"2026-10-14T13:57:18.000Z"},"weekly":{"status":"ok","percent":28,"resetsAt":"2026-10-19T00:00:00.000Z"},"monthly":{"status":"ok","percent":14,"resetsAt":"2026-11-13T02:53:31.000Z"}}}
```

@local/dsh-opencode-go-quota README · Requirements：- A DSH web profile, because the plugin uses the `connection` service.
- An OpenCode Go or Go Plus subscription and its API key, which starts with `oc_sk_`.
- Node.js as required by your DSH release. This repository is tested with DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 on Node.js 22.

@local/dsh-opencode-go-quota README · Set the API key：```json
{"usage":{"rolling":{"status":"ok","percent":14,"resetsAt":"2026-10-14T13:57:18.000Z"},"weekly":{"status":"ok","percent":28,"resetsAt":"2026-10-19T00:00:00.000Z"},"monthly":{"status":"ok","percent":14,"resetsAt":"2026-11-13T02:53:31.000Z"}}}
```
